  "description": "The NUKE Off Road Recumbent handcycle is unique. A capable, rear wheel drive recumbent handcycle with suspension. The Nuke was developed for riders not able or not interested in riding in the prone position (kneeling, face down). The recumbent position is comfortable. Need we say more? The Nuke rear suspension provides improved ride quality, downhill speed control and improved traction uphill. Increased ground clearance with 24” wheels, which yield improved traction, increased speed and a smoother ride. Replaceable derailleur hanger for the close encounters with rocks and logs. The frame has reinforced tubing joints at areas commonly associated with high stresses and breakages. Knee rests are reinforced at knee bar area for greater strength and longevity.",
